    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d280">

                <pb facs="0683" n="569" xml:id="pg569"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.00/2143: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">most secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-06">August 6, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1370. I have learned from a high official of the Turk[ish] Foreign Office that
                    the Turk Ambassador in Rome<anchor n="1" xml:id="d280-f1"/> has reported that
                    the Badoglio Government seeks to achieve four objectives.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>(1)</label>
                    <item>To take Italy out of the war.</item>
                    <label>(2)</label>
                    <item>To save the dynasty.</item>
                    <label>(3)</label>
                    <item>To maintain order throughout the country.</item>
                    <label>(4)</label>
                    <item>To check the growth of a movement in certain provinces of north-western
                        Italy to become part of France.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d280-f1" n="1" xml:id="d280-f1-content">
